2026-08-15T02:53:44.5646469Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-08-15T02:53:44.5647122Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-08-15T02:53:44.5647615Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
